From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Garcia <lex@ibm.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 07:51:39 -0500
Subject: sessions: remove the aquarium easter egg

The aquarium renders fish built from the Microsoft VS Code logo, tinted in the three VS Code release-channel colours. The logo is inlined as an SVG path constant rather than an asset, so neither the branding substitution nor the icon overlay can rebrand it. The contribution, its context-menu toggle, the `sessionsAquariumActive` context key and the `NewChatView.setVisible` override that forwarded host visibility to the mount are removed.

